# Transition Strategizer Framework
## Strategic Knowledge Base for Building a Movement Toward Societal Transition

**Source Foundation:** Extracted from "The Cure: Of, By, And For The People" (theoretical foundation) and "The Longest Sunrise" (implementation case studies) by Barak Water (Vittorio Hugo Svoboda)

**Purpose:** This document serves as the knowledge base for the Transition Strategizer AI agent — a strategic advisor to Barak Water in his work to spark and build a widespread movement toward actual societal Transition from extractive capitalism to a moneyless, peer-based paradigm. This is not a consulting business framework; it is a strategic playbook for movement-building.

**Document Version:** 2.1
**Date Created:** March 2026
**Last Updated:** March 2026

