## Corporate Accountability Post-Transition

### Asset Seizure and Institutional Change

**Process:**
- Identification of corporate assets and offices
- Orderly nonviolent occupation and inventory
- Transfer to community or worker control
- No compensation to previous owners (extraction remediation)
