**Objective:** Deconstruct corporate benevolence myths through transparency

**Records to Open:**
- Financial statements and profit-taking history
- Executive compensation and benefits
- Lobbying expenditures and influence campaigns
- Environmental impact and externalities
- Labor practices and wage suppression
- Product safety and harm data
- Tax avoidance schemes
- Campaign contributions and political influence

**Public Access:**
- Digital archives accessible to all
- Organized and searchable formats
- Community interpretation and analysis
- Educational materials
- Documentary and artistic presentations
- Museum exhibitions
